===Etymology 2===
{{etymid|fi|you}}
See {{m|fi|sä}}, {{m|fi|sinä}}; developed through contraction from {{m|fi|sinä}}, with a lengthened vowel.

====Pronoun====
{{fi-pron}}

# {{lb|fi|Häme dialect ~ Tampere and Turku}} [[you]] (''addressing one person; in archaic English'': [[thou]]).
