===Etymology 3===
{{etymid|fi|fiber}}
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*sää|id=thread}}, from {{inh|fi|urj-pro|*säŋä}}, {{m|urj-pro|*śäŋe}}. Cognates include {{cog|udm|си}}, {{cog|kca-nor|сеў}} and {{cog|hu|sző}}.

====Noun====
{{head|fi|noun}} {{tlb|fi|obsolete}}

# [[fiber]], [[thread]], [[strand]]

